WEBVTT

00:01:59.246 --> 00:02:02.204
The origin of the power failure
was the counterattack,

00:02:02.204 --> 00:02:05.371
but fragile infrastructure,
weak cybersecurity,

00:02:05.371 --> 00:02:07.663
and the bad state 
of the electricity network,

00:02:07.663 --> 00:02:10.704
contributed to the death of civilians.

00:02:10.704 --> 00:02:12.954
Could the country fight back ?

00:02:12.954 --> 00:02:14.371
Who would it fight?

00:02:14.371 --> 00:02:17.704
And would his retaliation 
be considered an act of war?

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:20.663
Do they constitute crimes
of war against humanity?

00:02:20.663 --> 00:02:22.829
Who should be held responsible?

00:02:22.829 --> 00:02:24.871
The programmers who wrote the code?

00:02:24.871 --> 00:02:28.996
The military project manager
who oversaw the creation of the code?

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:32.246
The commander who pressed the button
and triggered the event?